  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES_1
    value: LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_01
    value: WILD
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_01
    value: '- Appears on all reels and substitutes all symbols


      except               and               .'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_02
    value: SCATTER
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_02
    value: '- 3 Scatters anywhere on reels trigger <style=coinColor>Wild Stampede
      Free Games</style>.


      - <style=coinColor>5 Scatters</style> - trigger awards 25 Free Games.

      - <style=coinColor>4 Scatters</style> - trigger awards 12 Free Games.

      - <style=coinColor>3 Scatters</style> - trigger awards 8 Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_03
    value: SECOND CHANCE RE-SPIN
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_03
    value: '

      - When there are 5               symbols on reels including one or more               ,
      then Second Chance Re-Spin


      is triggered.


      - All Link symbols become locked and one or more extra Link symbols triggers
      Re-Spin Feature.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_04
    value: RE-SPIN FEATURE
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_04
    value: "- 6 or more Link symbols anywhere on reels trigger Re-Spin Feature.\n-
      Each Link symbol has a random number of Diamonds from 0 to 3.\n- Each Link symbol
      can have at most 3 Diamonds.\n\n- Any               on reels may increase Diamond
      amounts of one or more other Link symbols.\n\n- After Re-Spin Feature
      ends, player will win the prize from the ladder depending on the collected amount
      of Diamonds."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_05
    value: WILD STAMPEDE FREE GAMES
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_05
    value: '

      - During Wild Stampede Free Games,               appears with a random multiplier,
      X2 or X3.


      - Multiplier will be applied to the final result of Re-Spin Feature.'
